msgid "First connection to this server"
msgstr "第一次連到這台伺服器"

msgid "Compare this fingerprint with the one shown in the server admin TUI main menu. Only trust it if they are identical."
msgstr "請與伺服器 Admin TUI 主選單顯示的指紋比對，完全相同才信任。"

